+\paragraph{Attacks and the exact missing calculation.}
+B.11 does lift each vector without the symmetry condition.
+The first attempted symmetry argument, coprime
+nonabelian $H^1$ vanishing, fails because $6$ is not
+invertible. We replaced this argument by the full
